      "product": "bpc-157",
      "title": "What BPC-157 is, where it comes from, and what is unknown",
      "style": "explainer",
      "beats": [
        {
          "text": "So, BPC-157 is a peptide, which is just amino acids linked together. This one is lab-made, and it's fifteen amino acids long.",
