          "screen": null,
          "emph": [
            "peptide",
            "linked",
            "fifteen"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where does it come from? Start with the human stomach. The fluid in there has a protein, a long chain of amino acids. And BPC-157 is based on one short piece of that chain.",
