          },
          "screen": "The research",
          "emph": [
            "lab",
            "animal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Human research is very limited, so the big questions are still open: does it work in people, and is it safe?",
          "visual": {
            "type": "versus",
            "labels": [
              "So far",
              "Still open"
            ],
            "myth": "Lab and animal research",
            "fact": "Does it work in people? Is it safe?",
